        "node_id": "n_2_d17a5d",
        "thought_text": "For even k, place half of the ones on the upper triangle of the matrix (including the diagonal), and the rest on the lower triangle. This ensures symmetry and maximizes the lexicographical order by placing ones as late as possible in each row.",
